units in
template plain_b.ps
field Title CUP, CUBICAL
field Number TBD
field Rev A
field Drawn JK 11/13/26
material 5052-H32 ALUMINUM ALLOY, %%t THICK.
finish ALODINE CLEAR (ROHS COMPLIANT).
boxed PART MARKING: VENDOR ID, MONTH/YEAR OF MANUFACTURE, PART NUMBER, \
    AND CURRENT REVISION LEVEL USING METAL AND/OR RUBBER STAMP, \
    APPROXIMATELY WHERE SHOWN.
note REMOVE ALL BURRS AND SHARP EDGES.
note BEND RADII SHALL BE .03 MAX.
revision A 11/13/26 JK INITIAL RELEASE
view top
 flag .5in 1.5in 3
view front
view right
view flat title FLAT PATTERN
